</html>	## Insurtech Industry Analysis: APAC Focus (November 2025)

This analysis synthesizes recent developments across the Asia-Pacific (APAC) insurance and fintech landscape, focusing on regulatory changes, digital transformation, funding trends, and the strategic implications of AI adoption.

